    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go back through the exchange around Dima is Waiting line by line and unpack how the Russian works.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "hostess",
      "t": "Здравствуйте.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello.' Hostess offers a standard greeting to the chef.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Доброе утро.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Good morning.' Barinov replies with a standard morning greeting.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "hostess",
      "t": "Шеф, вас ожидают.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chef, they are waiting for you.' Stopping the chef by the kitchen doors, the hostess politely informs him that someone is waiting for him.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Кто меня ждет?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who is waiting for me?' Barinov demands to know exactly who is looking for him.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "hostess",
      "t": "Дима тебя ждет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Dima is waiting for you.' She clarifies that restaurant owner Dmitry Nagiyev is asking for him in the dining room.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Нагиев здесь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nagiyev is here?' Barinov reacts with surprise that the owner is on the premises.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "hostess",
      "t": "Да, он за своим столом.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, he is at his table.' Pointing toward the hall, she confirms that Nagiyev is sitting at his usual corner table.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Что он хочет?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What does he want?' Barinov questions the owner's motives for showing up unannounced.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "hostess",
      "t": "Я не знаю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I do not know.' When Viktor asks what the boss wants, the hostess shrugs and admits she has no idea.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Обычно он сначала звонит.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He usually calls first.' Barinov points out this breaks Nagiyev's usual habit of calling ahead.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "hostess",
      "t": "Он кажется очень взволнованным.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He seems very excited.' Hostess notes that the owner appears quite worked up today.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Хорошо, я иду.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Okay, I am coming.' Barinov resigns himself to the meeting and says he will go.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Принеси ему немного кофе.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
